    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SearchResult</code></a> with the given content and <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个包含给定内容和<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>的新<a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SearchResult</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SearchResult</code></a> by applying the given mapping <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> to this result's content.",
      "translation": "通过将此结果的内容应用于给定的映射 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SearchResult</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>SearchResult</code></a> with the given content and a raw score value.",
      "translation": "使用给定的内容和原始分数值创建一个新的<a href=\"SearchResult.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>SearchResult</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a> associated with this result.",
      "translation": "返回与此结果关联的<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>Score</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the content associated with this result.",
      "translation": "返回与此结果关联的内容。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically used in the context of similarity-based or vector search operations where each result carries a relevance\n<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>. Provides accessor methods for the content and its score, along with transformation support via\n<a href=\"#map(java.util.function.Function)\"><code>map(Function)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通常用于基于相似度或向量搜索的操作中，其中每个结果都携带一个相关性<a href=\"Score.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Score</code></a>。提供用于访问内容和其分数的方法，并通过<a href=\"#map(java.util.function.Function)\"><code>map(Function)</code></a>支持转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
